{"cast":"velvet","group":"three","bank":"three.38ff445bdf.bin","lines":[{"id":"three.intro.01","moment":"three.intro","text":"Now playing: Downtown on the Rooftop. Five racks, sixty seconds, money balls worth two. Six shooters, top three move on.","off":0,"len":38603,"sec":8.037},{"id":"three.intro.02","moment":"three.intro","text":"It's Downtown, city. Six shooters, five racks, sixty seconds on the clock, and only three get to stay up late.","off":38603,"len":34897,"sec":6.934},{"id":"three.intro.03","moment":"three.intro","text":"Downtown tonight: sixty seconds, five racks, a money ball on every one. Six in the field. Three advance.","off":73500,"len":34912,"sec":7.02},{"id":"three.go.01","moment":"three.go","text":"Drop the needle.","off":108412,"len":8726,"sec":0.909},{"id":"three.go.02","moment":"three.go","text":"Sixty seconds. Now.","off":117138,"len":11869,"sec":1.566},{"id":"three.go.03","moment":"three.go","text":"And... we're live.","off":129007,"len":9288,"sec":1.012},{"id":"three.rack.01","moment":"three.rack","text":"Next rack.","off":138295,"len":8542,"sec":0.805},{"id":"three.rack.02","moment":"three.rack","text":"Keep moving, keep smooth.","off":146837,"len":10843,"sec":1.355},{"id":"three.rack.03","moment":"three.rack","text":"Stay in the pocket.","off":157680,"len":9295,"sec":1.013},{"id":"three.rack.04","moment":"three.rack","text":"Flip the record.","off":166975,"len":8949,"sec":0.917},{"id":"three.lastrack.01","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Last rack. Finish the song.","off":175924,"len":11887,"sec":1.618},{"id":"three.lastrack.02","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Final rack. Make it sing.","off":187811,"len":11587,"sec":1.498},{"id":"three.lastrack.03","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"One rack left, headliner.","off":199398,"len":11592,"sec":1.469},{"id":"three.money.01","moment":"three.money","text":"Money ball. Double the tip.","off":210990,"len":11389,"sec":1.49},{"id":"three.money.02","moment":"three.money","text":"Here comes the gold one.","off":222379,"len":10381,"sec":1.254},{"id":"three.money.03","moment":"three.money","text":"The pricey one. Go on.","off":232760,"len":10918,"sec":1.39},{"id":"three.money.04","moment":"three.money","text":"Big one. Easy now.","off":243678,"len":10176,"sec":1.227},{"id":"three.make.01","moment":"three.make","text":"Smooth.","off":253854,"len":7439,"sec":0.648},{"id":"three.make.02","moment":"three.make","text":"Easy.","off":261293,"len":6953,"sec":0.59},{"id":"three.make.03","moment":"three.make","text":"Silk.","off":268246,"len":6957,"sec":0.58},{"id":"three.make.04","moment":"three.make","text":"Right there.","off":275203,"len":7932,"sec":0.692},{"id":"three.make.05","moment":"three.make","text":"That's jazz.","off":283135,"len":8449,"sec":0.818},{"id":"three.make.06","moment":"three.make","text":"Soft as velvet.","off":291584,"len":9363,"sec":1.036},{"id":"three.make.money.01","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Tip jar's full.","off":300947,"len":9183,"sec":1.022},{"id":"three.make.money.02","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Gold record.","off":310130,"len":8480,"sec":0.841},{"id":"three.make.money.03","moment":"three.make.money","text":"That's two, thank you.","off":318610,"len":9748,"sec":1.099},{"id":"three.make.money.04","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Paid in full.","off":328358,"len":8159,"sec":0.843},{"id":"three.miss.01","moment":"three.miss","text":"No.","off":336517,"len":7074,"sec":0.482},{"id":"three.miss.02","moment":"three.miss","text":"Off.","off":343591,"len":6464,"sec":0.504},{"id":"three.miss.03","moment":"three.miss","text":"Flat note.","off":350055,"len":8445,"sec":0.795},{"id":"three.miss.04","moment":"three.miss","text":"Not that one.","off":358500,"len":8740,"sec":0.826},{"id":"three.miss.05","moment":"three.miss","text":"Next.","off":367240,"len":7458,"sec":0.58},{"id":"three.streak.01","moment":"three.streak","text":"Now there's a groove.","off":374698,"len":9574,"sec":1.011},{"id":"three.streak.02","moment":"three.streak","text":"In a rhythm now.","off":384272,"len":8668,"sec":0.921},{"id":"three.streak.03","moment":"three.streak","text":"Keep that record spinning.","off":392940,"len":10605,"sec":1.296},{"id":"three.streak.04","moment":"three.streak","text":"The city's catching on.","off":403545,"len":10382,"sec":1.259},{"id":"three.fire.01","moment":"three.fire","text":"Every note lands.","off":413927,"len":9498,"sec":1.088},{"id":"three.fire.02","moment":"three.fire","text":"Nobody breathe. Keep playing.","off":423425,"len":13135,"sec":1.935},{"id":"three.fire.03","moment":"three.fire","text":"Pure music! Don't stop!","off":436560,"len":11198,"sec":1.41},{"id":"three.fire.04","moment":"three.fire","text":"Still perfect! Still going!","off":447758,"len":11482,"sec":1.526},{"id":"three.cold.01","moment":"three.cold","text":"Rough patch. Reset, breathe.","off":459240,"len":12565,"sec":1.762},{"id":"three.cold.02","moment":"three.cold","text":"Off beat. Breathe, then swing.","off":471805,"len":12604,"sec":1.785},{"id":"three.cold.03","moment":"three.cold","text":"Three misses. Slow it down.","off":484409,"len":11710,"sec":1.548},{"id":"three.clock.01","moment":"three.clock","text":"Ten seconds. Hurry, smoothly.","off":496119,"len":13895,"sec":2.027},{"id":"three.clock.02","moment":"three.clock","text":"Final ten seconds!","off":510014,"len":9984,"sec":1.168},{"id":"three.clock.03","moment":"three.clock","text":"Tempo up. Ten left.","off":519998,"len":11490,"sec":1.529},{"id":"three.buzzer.01","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Horn sounded. Ball didn't care.","off":531488,"len":12773,"sec":1.908},{"id":"three.buzzer.02","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Late arrival. Still on the list.","off":544261,"len":12653,"sec":1.829},{"id":"three.buzzer.03","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Snuck in before closing!","off":556914,"len":10450,"sec":1.301},{"id":"three.results.01","moment":"three.results","text":"Reading the numbers now, slowly. Stay with me.","off":567364,"len":16755,"sec":2.75},{"id":"three.results.02","moment":"three.results","text":"Results, city. Let's see who stays up late.","off":584119,"len":15064,"sec":2.394},{"id":"three.advance.01","moment":"three.advance","text":"You're in the final. The late set belongs to you.","off":599183,"len":16192,"sec":2.643},{"id":"three.advance.02","moment":"three.advance","text":"Top three, headliner. Next stop, the final.","off":615375,"len":16556,"sec":2.704},{"id":"three.advance.03","moment":"three.advance","text":"Advancing to the final. The skyline wants an encore.","off":631931,"len":18610,"sec":3.224},{"id":"three.out.01","moment":"three.out","text":"Not tonight. The final goes on without you, but the roof remembers.","off":650541,"len":21825,"sec":4.037},{"id":"three.out.02","moment":"three.out","text":"Cut from the setlist tonight. Rehearse, and come back strong.","off":672366,"len":19459,"sec":3.362},{"id":"three.out.03","moment":"three.out","text":"That's the end of your set. Good crowd, though. Come back soon.","off":691825,"len":18700,"sec":3.192},{"id":"three.final.01","moment":"three.final","text":"The final. Headliner closes the show, and the number's already up.","off":710525,"len":21224,"sec":3.805},{"id":"three.final.02","moment":"three.final","text":"Last shooter of the night. The number's on the board. Top it.","off":731749,"len":19058,"sec":3.278},{"id":"three.final.03","moment":"three.final","text":"Final round. Everybody else has posted. Now it's your song.","off":750807,"len":20436,"sec":3.637},{"id":"three.clinch.01","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Passed it. Cue the applause.","off":771243,"len":11335,"sec":1.472},{"id":"three.clinch.02","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Won! Right there, won!","off":782578,"len":10022,"sec":1.109},{"id":"three.clinch.03","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Past the number. That's the song.","off":792600,"len":12577,"sec":1.757},{"id":"three.champion.01","moment":"three.champion","text":"Downtown belongs to you. The city waited all night for a shooter like that.","off":805177,"len":23505,"sec":4.326},{"id":"three.champion.02","moment":"three.champion","text":"Best shooter on the roof tonight. I'll be playing that one back all week.","off":828682,"len":21319,"sec":3.759},{"id":"three.champion.03","moment":"three.champion","text":"Every window in the city just flicked its lights for you. Champion.","off":850001,"len":20809,"sec":3.757}]}